{"id":"vtornik","lemma":"вторник","pos":"noun","rank":1486,"glosses":["Tuesday"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/26/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"вторника","plural":"вторники"},"examples":[{"text":"Давай встретимся во вторник.","en":"Let's meet on Tuesday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728287","words":[{"g":"let's"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретиться"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Ты свободен во вторник?","en":"Are you free on Tuesday?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Мы должны всё закончить до утра вторника.","en":"We must finish everything before Tuesday morning.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to finish, to end"},{"g":"until / before"},{"g":"a.m."},null]},{"text":"Сегодня не вторник?","en":"Isn't it Tuesday?","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Я дочитаю эту книгу до вторника.","en":"I will have finished reading this book by Tuesday.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,{"g":"until / before"},null]}]}